      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1429,
      "text": "Do not let their words grieve you. Indeed, all power belongs to Allah. He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 216,
      "ruku": 178,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1430,
      "text": "Indeed, to Allah belongs all those who are in the heavens and all those who are on earth. Those who invoke [so-called] partners besides Allah follow nothing but conjecture and they do nothing but lie.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 216,
      "ruku": 178,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1431,
      "text": "It is He Who made the night for you to rest therein and the day bright. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who listen.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 216,
      "ruku": 178,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1432,
      "text": "They say, “Allah has taken a son.” Glory be to Him! He is the Self-Sufficient. To Him belongs all that is in the heavens and all that is on earth. You have no proof for this. Do you[52] say about Allah something that you do not know?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 216,
      "ruku": 178,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1433,
      "text": "Say, “Those who fabricate lies against Allah will never succeed.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
